OL,3,GNEWSAMan completes reverse 300-mile
OL,4,AJarrow March
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has walked from London to Jarrow
OL,7,Fto commemorate the 90th anniversary of
OL,8,Fthe Jarrow March.
OL,10,FIn 1936 about 200 men marched 300 miles
OL,11,F(483km) from Jarrow in protest over a
OL,12,Flack of investment and employment.
OL,14,FLiam Little, who is from the town, set
OL,15,Foff from London on 5 October to make
OL,16,Fthe journey in reverse to fundraise for
OL,17,Fthe charity Groundwork. He arrived on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
