OL,3,GNEWSAMan completes reverse 300-mile
OL,4,AJarrow March
OL,5,
OL,6,FLittle said he had carried out the walk
OL,7,Fto try and bring people together and
OL,8,Fshowcase the potential of the
OL,9,Fcollective action of the original
OL,10,Fmarchers decades earlier.
